INSERT INTO `teams` VALUES (7,'Michael Monnot','Business Broker / 941.518.7138','mike@infinitybusinessbrokers.com','<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d0dd1772-7fff-2bf8-9480-1441c560c7a8\"><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Michael has been directly or indirectly involved in all aspects of the buying, selling, financing and/or brokering of hundreds of businesses. Michael has experience as a small business owner and entrepreneur, having owned several businesses. His business ownership experience includes commercial finance, real estate investment, financial services and marketing. As a former owner/operator he knows the tremendous potential, as well as challenging demands, any current or future business owner must face. Operations, marketing, financing and strategic planning are a few of the areas where Michael has extensive knowledge and practical experience. These insights coupled with a BBA allow Michael to be a valuable asset in helping any business owner, investor or entrepreneur achieve their goals.</span></h4></span>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2025-03-08/QsHPXBikdv5I0926MPWB1teAaMpiTI6ptJO72YZX.jpg','2025-01-19 23:56:20','2025-03-14 20:33:53'),(14,'Daniel Dolamic','Business Broker / 813.344.9615','daniel@md-florida.com','<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b1dc41dd-7fff-2ad6-e2d1-3255913bbea0\"><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I\'ve been helping people achieve their American Dream since 2019, guiding them through the complexities of E-2 visa applications. My journey started long before that, though. After earning two degrees from the University of South Carolina, I worked in economic development for the US state of West Virginia in Germany, assisting companies from across Europe expanding into the US market. This experience gave me valuable insights into the challenges and opportunities faced by international businesses, particularly when moving or expanding to the United States.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Since 2019, I\'ve been a licensed Florida sales associate. I am fluent in German and English, allowing me to provide personalized support to a diverse clientele, including German-speaking entrepreneurs. I understand the unique needs of international investors and can provide tailored guidance and support to help them achieve their goals in Florida.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Why Work with Daniel Dolamic?</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Deep Understanding of the E-2 Visa Process: I\'ve helped hundreds of clients successfully obtain their E-2 visas and launch thriving businesses.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Expertise in the Florida Market: I\'m a licensed Florida business broker with extensive knowledge of the local business landscape.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dedicated Support for International Clients: I\'m fluent in German and English, and I\'m passionate about helping entrepreneurs from around the world achieve their American Dream.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Global Perspective: With experience working in both Europe and the US, I offer a unique global perspective to help your business thrive in the American market.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Comprehensive Services: In partnership with M&amp;D Florida Services Inc., I offer a full range of services, including business plan development, corporate filings, and expert E-2 visa guidance.</span></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 6pt;\"><br></h4></span>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2025-03-09/HabZIUjK8AT6xgWAwtcIvZCnqb2dYj2WeIhRqTdN.png','2025-03-08 03:13:27','2026-06-17 02:45:27'),(15,'Michael Finley','Business Broker / 708.949.6193','michael@sellmyflorida.house','<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Michael Finley stands out as a business broker for his comprehensive understanding of the entrepreneurial landscape, enhanced by his academic achievements and practical experience. His professionalism, coupled with a genuine commitment to client success, makes him an invaluable partner for those looking to buy or sell a business.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Michael Finley is a proud Marine Corps and Operation Iraqi Freedom (OIF) veteran with a robust foundation in leadership and strategic planning. Although originally from Chicago, Michael has found his paradise in Southwest Florida, where he enjoys life with his wife and two young children. Michael’s professional path is underpinned by an impressive array of entrepreneurial ventures, signaling not just a career but a calling to innovate, develop, and lead successful businesses.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Michael’s entrepreneurial journey is characterized by the successful founding and development of several businesses. This hands-on experience, combined with an MBA, equips him with a profound understanding of business strategy, financial acumen, and operational excellence. His deep-rooted passion for entrepreneurship is matched by his commitment to lifelong learning and professional development.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">While entrepreneurship takes center stage in Michael’s career, his expertise is further bolstered by over 10 years of experience in real estate as both an investor and as a licensed real estate agent, having taken part in over 400 real estate transactions. This experience not only serves as a testament to his versatile investment skills but, having honed the art of negotiation, it also enriches his comprehensive advisory capabilities in the business brokerage realm.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">At the heart of Michael’s professional ethos is an unwavering dedication to his clients. Whether they are seeking to buy or sell a business, Michael’s goal remains the same: to guide them towards making informed decisions that align with their aspirations and financial objectives. His unique blend of entrepreneurial experience, business education, and negotiation prowess ensures that his clients are well-positioned for success in any transaction.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2026-08-06/5MWGKOxhRXWDAUiIMYWUrRCcz9FuO2KRtjJWAyjF.png','2025-03-08 03:14:40','2026-08-06 21:29:18'),(16,'Steven Moore','Business Broker / 239.860.6712','steve@dealendeavors.com','<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">In a past life, Steve was a Computer Engineer in the US Air Force, and subsequently, a Sales Executive for some large Fortune 500 firms like Cisco Systems, as well as some smaller lesser-known startups. His experience with Big Data and the overall High-Tech arena over two decades is what got him in tune with the mindset of entrepreneurs spanning a wide variety of industries.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">As a left-brain individual, Steve is organized and systematic, which is what it takes to be a good Business Broker. He knows how to usher individuals through the process that puts buyers and sellers together. Steve really loves what he does, helping people who are living the ultimate dream of owning their own business and becoming their own boss.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(129, 132, 138); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">As a Business Broker and Commercial Realtor, Steve is licensed to work with just about any trade, including Information Technology, Construction, Accommodations and Food Services, Arts, Entertainment, and Recreation, Business Services, Bars and Taverns, to name a few. Whether yours is a small Main Street business in need of some Pre-Sale preparation, or a larger Middle Market business looking for a private equity infusion, please reach out to Steve for assistance.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2025-03-08/2rL8p70sXYnj14sdKX6Ee4W7bl2JWoAAbsxxmd5l.jpg','2025-03-08 03:16:51','2025-03-08 03:16:51'),(17,'Doug Pedersen','Business Broker / 937.654.6102','Doug@InfinityBusinessBrokers.com','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Doug has an B.S. in accounting&nbsp; and has worked as a Controller in the private sector for over 20 years.&nbsp;After leaving the corporate world, Doug bought his 1st business and doubled sales in the 5 1/2 years that he owned it. Doug has since bought and sold 3 other business. Through Doug’s corporate background and business entrepreneurship,&nbsp; Doug has built great insight on how to run a small business and loves sharing this knowledge with buyers and sellers as a Certified Main Street Business Broker (CMSBB). Doug’s easy going manner with seller’s and buyers is what has made Doug successful in getting deals done.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Industry Experience: eCommerce, Marketing, Business Services, SAAS and other software and computer services, General Construction, Manufacturing, Retail and Distribution.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">AWARDS AND RECOGNITION:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Certified Main Street Business Broker</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">B.S. Accounting</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Sunbelt Presidents Club – 2020</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Licensed in Florida and Minnesota</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">PERSONAL INTERESTS:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Spending time with Family</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -18pt; text-indent: 36pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Camping in our 5th Wheel</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Boating, Playing Hockey, Water Skiing, Biking, Staying Fit, Pickle Ball</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"image.png\" style=\"width: 375px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"image.png\" style=\"width: 330px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(81, 81, 81); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span></p>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2025-03-14/w9Piux6veS94huWDgueSIVq4V1devJGyrKam5qbC.png','2025-03-08 03:19:21','2025-03-14 22:32:42'),(18,'Eric Camehl','Business Broker / 813.344.9615','eric@mainstreetexits.net','<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eric Camehl is a licensed Business Acquisition &amp; Sales Specialist with Infinity Business Brokers, serving business sellers and buyers nationwide.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eric\'s path to brokerage ran through nine years as a U.S. Army combat veteran, leading counter-narcotics operations and teams in high-stakes environments where preparation, discipline, and composed decision-making meant everything.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">After his service, he did what he now helps clients do: he bought a business. Over five years he took a hands-on service company, systematized it into an absentee-run operation with recurring revenue and a real team, grew sales 300%, and sold it. He then built and led a real estate brokerage as broker/owner — managing the P&amp;L, leading a team of 60+ agents, coaching brand-new agents to six-figure first years, and personally guiding clients through valuation, negotiation, and close.</span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 5pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b27434b4-7fff-97cc-95c8-2f012bdc5ea4\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eric has been the buyer, the operator, and the seller. He brings all three perspectives to every engagement, helping owners across all 50 states prepare, position, and exit their life\'s work. Start with a free, confidential valuation.</span></p>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2026-08-06/rtptC1nNY55i5JsNTOu3hcZldxLAz4C5Twv3Vh1b.png','2025-03-08 03:21:13','2026-08-07 03:14:15'),(19,'Phillip Rizzo','Business Broker / 239.405.1284','phillip@infinitybusinessbrokers.com','<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#434343;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phillip is an accomplished business broker with a unique blend of expertise from owning and operating a successful home health care business. With 8 years of experience in business sales, mergers, ownership, and acquisitions, Phillip leverages deep industry knowledge, strategic negotiation skills, and a client-focused approach to drive seamless transactions across diverse sectors.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#434343;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Drawing on his background in home health care, Phillip brings firsthand insight into operational management, regulatory compliance, and client care, making him exceptionally adept at valuing businesses and identifying growth opportunities. Known for fostering trust and confidentiality, Phillip guides buyers and sellers through complex deals with clarity and precision.</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e3a15e6a-7fff-a02c-6a9c-87c5507cb64f\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#434343;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phillip stays attuned to market trends to deliver informed advice. Passionate about empowering entrepreneurs, he is dedicated to helping clients achieve their goals with integrity and expertise.</span></p>','https://infinitybusinessbrokers.com/storage/team_photos/2025-04-15/lhTfNB0mnLVFdQCUTUYA3PiSOKJ38HcJDxNJIpRC.jpg','2025-04-14 23:42:40','2025-04-15 00:04:36');
